===''Pokémon the Series''===
===={{aniseries|XY}}====
In ''[[XY020|Breaking Titles at the Chateau!]]'', [[Nico]]'s rank was upgraded from {{tc|Baron}} to Viscount after he defeated another Baron-ranked Trainer, [[Farrell]], in a {{pkmn|battle}} at the Battle Chateau.

In {{aniseries|PTS}}, a Baron needs to achieve ten victories at the Battle Chateau in order to be promoted to Viscount.
